    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Luring prey with a sweet scent, it\nuses poison whips on its arms\nto poison, bind, and finish off the prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あまい　かおりで　えものを　さそい\nりょううでの　どくのムチを　つかって\nさしたり　しめたりして　しとめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "달콤한 향기로 먹이를 유인해\n양팔의 독 채찍을 사용하여\n찌르거나 조여서 꼼짝 못하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il attire ses proies grâce à son parfum, puis les\nempoisonne ou les étouffe à l’aide de ses bras\nvénéneux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lockt seine Beute mit süßem Duft an, um sie\ndanach mit seinen dornigen Ranken zu peitschen\noder zu würgen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Atrae a sus presas con una dulce fragancia y usa sus\ncepas venenosas para atenazarlas y acabar con ellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attira la preda con il suo profumo soave per poi\nafferrarla e abbatterla con gli arti velenosi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips\non its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "甘い　香りで　獲物を　誘い\n両腕の　毒のムチを　使って\n刺したり　締めたりして　しとめる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Atrae a sus presas con una dulce fragancia y usa sus\ncepas venenosas para atenazarlas y acabar con ellas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ダンサーのような　みのこなしで\nどくの　トゲが　びっしりと　ならんだ\nムチを　あやつり　こうげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "댄서 같은 재빠른 몸놀림으로\n독가시가 빽빽이 늘어선\n채찍을 조종하여 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracieux comme un danseur, il abat ses fouets ornés\nd’épines empoisonnées.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit den Bewegungen eines Tänzers holt es aus und\nschlägt mit Ranken um sich, die giftige Dornen haben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se mueve como un bailarín y golpea con látigos\nrepletos de púas venenosas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
